text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_08171EE0 {
    "{ARCHIE}: What happened...\nWhat is this wretched scene...\pDid I...make a horrible mistake?"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_08171F35 {
    "I...\nI only wanted..."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_08171F4B {
    "{MAXIE}: Do you understand now,\n{ARCHIE}?\pDo you finally see how disastrous\nyour dream turned out to be?\pWe have to hurry! We have to do\nsomething before the situation goes\lcompletely out of control!"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_08172008 {
    "{MAXIE}: {PLAYER}{KUN}...\pWe, TEAM {MAGMA}, had been pursuing TEAM\n{AQUA} to prevent this from happening.\pYou’ve been very helpful, but I fear\nthe worst has happened...\pIt’s gone too far for a child like you\nto manage...\pLeave things to us, and get out of\nhere while you still can!"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_0817210B {
    "{MAXIE}: This defies belief...\pA super-ancient POKéMON...\pIts power is unbelievable.\nIt has upset the balance of nature..."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_08172181 {
    "STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\nWhat is happening?"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081722A1 {
    "This is terrible...\pIf this doesn’t stop, all of HOENN...\nNo, the whole world will be parched.\pThe cause of this calamity, the blazing\nsun, is in the sky above SOOTOPOLIS...\pWhat in the world is taking place there?\pThere’s no point arguing here...\nSOOTOPOLIS should provide answers..."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081723BE {
    "{PLAYER}{KUN}...\nI don’t know what you intend to do,\lbut don’t do anything reckless.\pOkay.\nI’m going to SOOTOPOLIS."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1DB0 {
    "You have to swim, cycle, and then run\na marathon in a triathlon.\pIt’s a grueling race that consists\nof three events."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1E25 {
    "A POKéMON battle is grueling, too..."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1E4A {
    "I have to ride a BIKE next, but...\nI’m about to throw in the towel..."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1E90 {
    "A triathlon is long. But I guess the\nroad to become the POKéMON CHAMPION\lis also a long and grueling one."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1EFA {
    "A POKéMON battle really is harsh\nand unforgiving..."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1F2E {
    "You should give serious thought to\nchallenges on VICTORY ROAD."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1F6D {
    "We’ve been working so hard to mount\na POKéMON LEAGUE challenge...\pWe can’t afford to lose now!"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1FCC {
    "Oh!\nHow could this happen?!"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C1FE8 {
    "After all I’ve done to get here, I won’t\ngive up after one setback."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C202C {
    "There is no stronger TRAINER than I!"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C2051 {
    "This can’t be!"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C2060 {
    "There probably is no stronger TRAINER\nthan you!"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C2090 {
    "I want to visit EVER GRANDE, so I\ncaught myself a POKéMON that knows\lthe move WATERFALL to crest the falls."
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C20FC {
    "I’m crestfallen!"
}

text Naranja_Route128_G00_M43_Text_081C210D {
    "Awww, phooey!\pMy POKéMON know WATERFALL, but\nI don’t have the SOOTOPOLIS GYM BADGE!"
}
